    "created_at": "2020-02-24T12:44:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-02-24T12:44:02Z",
    "body": "From the docs I expected these to be a combination of prefix/suffix.  So,\r\n```\r\n[directory]                                                                     \r\ntruncation_length = 0                                                           \r\ntruncate_to_repo = false                                                        \r\nprefix = \":\"                                                                    \r\n                                                                                \r\n[username]                                                                      \r\nshow_always = true                                                              \r\nsuffix = \"\"                                                                     \r\n                                                                                \r\n[hostname]                                                                      \r\nprefix = \"@\"                                                                    \r\nsuffix = \"\"                                                                     \r\n```\r\n\r\nresulted in \r\n```\r\n<username> on @<hostname> :<directory>\r\n❯ \r\n```\r\n\r\nSeems, the prefix of directory was the only one that work as expected.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
