    "created_at": "2020-08-24T15:37:08Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-24T15:37:08Z",
    "body": "With the new format config, this is possible:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[username]\r\nformat = \"[$user]($style)\"\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\nformat = \"@[$hostname]($style):\"\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\ntruncation_length = 8\r\ntruncate_to_repo = false\r\n``` \r\n\r\ndisplays as \r\n``` \r\njs@littlebottom2:~/external\r\n[17:31:36] λ\r\n```  ",
